  "title": "List of rulers of Kano",
  "content": "This is a list of rulers of Kano since the establishment of the Bagauda Dynasty in 999. The early rulers are known almost exclusively from a single source, the Kano Chronicle, which was composed in the late 19th century.\n\n\n== Bagauda dynasty (999–1809) ==\n\nNames and dates taken from John Stewart's African States and Rulers (1989):\n\n\n=== Kings (999 – 1349) ===\n\n\n=== Sultans (1349 – 1807) ===\n\n\n== Suleiman's reign (1807–1819) ==\n\n\n== Dabo dynasty (1819–present) ==\n\n\n== Lineages ==\n\n\n=== Hausa rulers ===\n\n\n=== Fulani rulers ===\n\n\n== See also ==\n\nHausa Kingdoms\nKano Chronicle\nTimeline of Kano\n\n\n== References ==",
